{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜藤嶌果歩(19)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真集発売まであと1ヶ月です♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#果実の歩幅\nみんなの元に届くのがとっても楽しみ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobAQYmJX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日の先行カットのオフショットです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mob9pZSSb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobOaGcTO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/moboGva8B.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "白いワンピースでお花と一緒に撮りたいです🌸ってお願いをしたんだ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夢が叶って嬉しい限りです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他にも先日公開されたウェイトレスさんの衣装とかも、写真集でこれやりたいです！ってお願いしたシリーズ✨✨\nフリフリを着れてハッピーな撮影でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オフショットインスタ載せたから見てね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだお気に入りのカットがございますので\nこれから解禁される写真も楽しみに待っててね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "公式Xはフォローしてくれてるかな！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "フォローまだの方用にリンク載せます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↓↓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://x.com/kahorin1st"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はい！フォローしたよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "--------------------"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近の歌番組〜\nインスタに載せていないオフショットたちをのせますよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは！\n7月頭には\n「2026 FNS歌謡祭　夏」に出演させていただきました🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobBT2sk1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちもちFNS"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobqLpwbx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メロいFNS"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今日は！\n「THE MUSIC DAY」さんに出演させていただきました！みやざき犬たちかわいかったわん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202607/mobGjlM68.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちもちDAY"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "インスタの写真も見てねーー🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして\n7月18日には「音楽の日2026」に出演させていただきます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わくわくですねーー✨✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは今日はこの辺で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひらほーが果実の歩幅のことを\n真夏の果実ってずっと呼んでます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それは名曲〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「果実の歩幅」　略して果歩ね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "土曜日もお疲れさまです🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "藤嶌果歩"}], "source": "official"}